-- The eight hand-drawn diagrams become Prelum figures (each with its dark-theme
-- twin), so `:::diagram` means a Mermaid diagram on every site. Old revisions are
-- rewritten too, so restoring one never brings back the retired form. The alt
-- text is each drawing's own <desc>. updated_at is left alone: the post's words
-- did not change.
--> statement-breakpoint
